OL,3,GNEWSAFamily hopes mother's neglect
OL,4,Adeath leads to change
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a woman who died after
OL,7,Ffailures in her care have called for
OL,8,Flasting change following the
OL,9,Fpublication of a prevention of future
OL,10,Fdeaths report.
OL,12,FEunice Brookes, from Carlton in
OL,13,FLindrick in Nottinghamshire, was 82
OL,14,Fwhen she was admitted to Bassetlaw
OL,15,FHospital on 3 September 2025 with
OL,16,Fsevere abdominal pain and vomiting.
OL,18,FHer family said they had concerns about
OL,19,Fher care but her condition deteriorated
OL,20,Fbefore she died five days later.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
